id, \"My Lord is more knowing [than we or you] of who has come with guidance from Him and to whom will be succession in the home. Indeed, wrongdoers do not succeed.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"28:38","t":"And Pharaoh said, \"O eminent ones, I have not known you to have a god other than me. Then ignite for me, O Hāmān, [a fire] upon the clay and make for me a tower that I may look at the God of Moses. And indeed, I do think he is among the liars.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"28:39","t":"And he was arrogant, he and his soldiers, in the land, without right, and they thought that they would not be returned to Us.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"28:40","t":"So We took him and his soldiers and threw them into the sea. So see how was the end of the wrongdoers.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"28:41","t":"And We made them leaders inviting to the Fire, and on the Day of Resurrection they will not be helped.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"28:42","t":"And We caused to overtake them in this world a curse, and on the Day of Resurrection they will be of the despised.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"28:43","t":"And We gave Moses the Scripture, after We had destroyed the former generations, as enlightenment for the people and guidance and mercy that they might be reminded.","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":43,"sd":null}],"juz":20,"hizb":39,"surahs":[28],"sajdah":false}